"The supplier has open credit notes: %(credit_notes)s. Credit notes are not "
"netted in the file: reconcile them against this bill first, then export the "
"remaining amount."
msgstr ""
"Leverantören har öppna kreditfakturor: %(credit_notes)s. Kreditfakturor "
"kvittas inte i filen: stäm av dem mot den här fakturan först och exportera "
"sedan det återstående beloppet."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv/wizard/payment_export_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"These bills cannot be exported:\n"
"%(problems)s\n"
"\n"
"Untick them, or fix them and open the export again."
msgstr ""
"De här fakturorna kan inte exporteras:\n"
"%(problems)s\n"
"\n"
"Bocka ur dem, eller rätta dem och öppna exporten igen."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
