"Some bills were paid or credited another way after they were put in this file: their amount due\n"
"                        is now less than the amount in the file (marked in red below). Remove those payments in the\n"
"                        internet bank before signing, and cancel their lines here."
msgstr ""
"Några fakturor har betalats eller krediterats på annat sätt efter att de "
"lades i den här filen: deras belopp att betala är nu lägre än beloppet i "
"filen (rödmarkerade nedan). Ta bort de betalningarna i internetbanken innan "
"du signerar, och avbryt deras rader här."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The OCR number %(reference)s is the same as the supplier's invoice number. "
"Check on the invoice that it is the OCR reference; a payee that checks OCR "
"numbers rejects a wrong one."
msgstr ""
"OCR-numret %(reference)s är samma som leverantörens fakturanummer. "
"Kontrollera på fakturan att det är OCR-referensen; en mottagare som "
"kontrollerar OCR-nummer avvisar ett felaktigt."

