"The SEB payment file that holds this bill: a draft or exported file, or a "
"done file whose payment has not yet reached the bill."
msgstr ""
"SEB-betalfilen som håller fakturan: ett utkast eller en exporterad fil, "
"eller en klar fil vars betalning ännu inte nått fakturan."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv/models/l10n_se_payment_export.py:0
msgid "The account to pay from can only be changed on a draft file."
msgstr "Kontot att betala från kan bara ändras i en fil som är utkast."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The bank account %(account)s is registered at %(registered)s, but its "
"clearing number belongs to %(bank)s. Check the account number."
msgstr ""
"Bankkontot %(account)s är registrerat hos %(registered)s, men dess "
"clearingnummer hör till %(bank)s. Kontrollera kontonumret."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv.field_l10n_se_payment_export_line__holds_bill
msgid ""
"The bill cannot be exported again while this is set: the line is in a draft "
"or exported file, or in a done file whose payment has not yet reached the "
"bill (its amount due has not dropped by the amount paid)."
msgstr ""
"Fakturan kan inte exporteras igen så länge detta är satt: raden finns i ett "
"utkast eller en exporterad fil, eller i en klar fil vars betalning ännu inte"
" nått fakturan (beloppet att betala har inte minskat med det betalda "
"beloppet)."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv.field_l10n_se_payment_export_line__residual_short
msgid ""
"The bill's amount due is now less than the amount in the file: it was paid "
"or credited another way. Remove this payment in the internet bank before "
"signing."
msgstr ""
"Fakturans belopp att betala är nu lägre än beloppet i filen: den har "
"betalats eller krediterats på annat sätt. Ta bort betalningen i "
"internetbanken innan du signerar."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The payment date %(date)s is not a bank day (weekend or Swedish public "
"holiday). Check the date the internet bank shows after the upload."
msgstr ""
"Betaldagen %(date)s är ingen bankdag (helg eller svensk helgdag). "
"Kontrollera vilket datum internetbanken visar efter uppladdningen."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv.field_l10n_se_payment_export_wizard__acknowledged_warnings
msgid ""
"The warnings as they were when 'I have read the warnings' was ticked. A "
"warning that appears or changes afterwards needs a new acknowledgement."
msgstr ""
"Varningarna som de var när 'Jag har läst varningarna' bockades i. En varning"
" som tillkommer eller ändras därefter måste bekräftas på nytt."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv/wizard/payment_export_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The warnings changed after 'I have read the warnings' was ticked. Read them "
"again, then untick and tick it."
msgstr ""
"Varningarna har ändrats sedan 'Jag har läst varningarna' bockades i. Läs dem"
" igen och bocka sedan ur och i rutan."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv/models/l10n_se_payment_export.py:0
msgid ""
"These fields of an SEB payment file are set by its buttons only: %(fields)s."
msgstr ""
"De här fälten i en SEB-betalfil sätts bara av dess knappar: %(fields)s."

#. module: l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_payment_file_seb_csv/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Paid by direct debit: the supplier collects this bill from your account. Do "
"not pay it; reconcile it against the bank line instead."
msgstr ""
"Dras automatiskt: leverantören drar fakturan från ert konto. Betala den inte; "
"stäm av den mot bankraden i stället."
